  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1106.04 Basic Facility Closure Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1106.04 Basic Facility Closure Requirements. A facility shall close in conformance with Env-Sw 406, Env-Sw 506, Env-Sw 706, Env-Sw 807, and Env-Sw 1006 and the provisions of an approved closure plan in conformance with Env-Sw 1106.05.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1100); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2806.03); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14108, eff 11-13-24, EXPIRES: 11-13-34 (formerly Env-Sw 1106.03)",
